{"id":"digo","lemma":"digo","pos":"intj","rank":207,"glosses":["I mean; used to explain or correct a previous utterance"],"ipa":"/ˈdiɡo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-digo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Lo digo en serio.","en":"I mean it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438292"},{"text":"Hazlo como te digo.","en":"Do as I tell you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65895"},{"text":"Digo lo que pienso.","en":"I say what I think.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448920"},{"text":"Te lo digo luego.","en":"I'll tell you later.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/221746"},{"text":"Lo digo como es.","en":"I tell it like it is.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/823780"}]}